BT 1 0 0 1 0 69.5 Tm 1.016586 Tw /F5+0 8.1 Tf 9.7 TL (Using one open CPCB/KSPCB monthly file for a commercial-area station) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.994808 Tw (\(April 2019\002March 2020\), we found that night-time noise exceeded the) Tj T* 0 Tw .565391 Tw (prescribed limit in 11 of 12 months and day-time noise in 7 of 12, and that) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.29242 Tw (classical models \(ridge R\004 = -0.33; logistic regression F1 = 0.82, AUC =) Tj T* 0 Tw .294751 Tw (0.52\) do not outperform trivial baselines on such a short series. Future work) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.071469 Tw (should use daily or hourly data \(enabling weekday and festival-day analysis\),) Tj T* 0 Tw .809326 Tw (longer records and several stations, add traffic and weather covariates, and) Tj T* 0 Tw (verify the instrument anomalies with the monitoring agency.) Tj T* ET
